WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.889
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.889 --> 00:00:09.590
Today I am going to explain the American science
fiction comedy film called “Idiocracy.”

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.799
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.799 --> 00:00:17.000
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.340
The premise of the movie is set in the year
2005.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.099
At the beginning of the movie, it is narrated
that human evolution is at a turning point.

00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:29.859
Most science fiction theories predict that
the future of humans is going to be more advanced

00:00:29.859 --> 00:00:31.470
with smarter people.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:35.620
But because humans are already on the top
of the food chain their evolution takes a

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.250
turn for the worse.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.250
People grow dumber with time.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:45.390
In such conditions, the U.S. Army librarian
Corporal Joe Bauers is approached by his seniors

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.210
proposing him to be a part of an important
experiment.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:53.940
Joe, who had planned to stay a librarian till
retirement is annoyed but he has to follow

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:54.940
the orders.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:59.080
Then, we are taken to a private meeting between
some high ranking military officials.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.390
General Collins presents his ideas to the
other officers.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:06.750
He says that the scientists have invented
a human hibernation pod that can preserve

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.190
human beings for an indefinite amount of time.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:14.180
It is so humans can preserve their finest
men at their prime and revive them in the

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.320
time of need.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:19.510
They have chosen Joe to be the first test
experiment because he is the most average

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.850
man in the military and has no immediate family.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.080
Similarly, they also required a woman for
the experiment but they didn’t have a perfect

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.530
fit in the military.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.820
Hence, Collins chooses a prostitute named
Rita.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:36.220
He shows the officers pictures of him and
Rita’s manager Upgrayedd partying together

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.250
making everyone in the room uncomfortable.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:43.360
He ends the presentation by saying that the
subjects will be put into the pods tomorrow

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.020
and the experiment will go on for a year.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:49.820
Since the experiment is highly classified,
the officials present in the room aren’t

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.490
allowed to share the information with anyone.

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:56.040
The next day, Joe and Rita are together in
a waiting room.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:59.970
Joe introduces himself and asks Rita what
sector she is from.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:04.060
Not wanting to reveal that she is a prostitute,
Rita says that she is a painter.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:09.229
Then, both of them are put on IV and into
two human hibernation pods.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:13.670
Rita freaks out and tries getting up but Joe
assures her the scientists know what they

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:14.670
are doing.

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:18.700
He tells her they will only be inside for
a year so it will be perfectly fine.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.530
At last the two are sealed inside the pods.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:26.989
However, things start to go wrong when officer
collins is arrested in an attempted prostitution

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:27.989
ring.

00:02:27.989 --> 00:02:32.430
Along with him, Upgrayedd is also arrested
for being the ringmaster of a prostitution

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.430
ring.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.840
Hence, now no one is there to look after the
hibernation pods.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:41.349
Because of a scandal, the military base is
closed and the building the pods are in is

00:02:41.349 --> 00:02:42.560
demolished.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:46.560
Joe and Rita lie dormant in the pod as the
years pass.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.640
Although things look bad for the two, they
are even worse for mankind.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.579
Humans begin to evolve stupider at a frightening
rate.

00:02:54.579 --> 00:02:57.870
The chart of average intelligence goes downhill
with time.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:02.510
Some people have high hopes that genetic engineering
and science will be able to correct this trend

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:07.549
of evolution, but the smartest scientists
in the world are focusing on stupid experiments

00:03:07.549 --> 00:03:11.230
like trying to reverse hair loss and prolong
erections.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:18.120
In the meantime, the population explodes and
intelligence continues to decline until the

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.099
year 2505.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:25.130
All these years, people aren’t able to solve
basic human problems like garbage disposal.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.610
So the garbage has been stacked for centuries
with no plan whatsoever.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:33.469
This creates the great garbage avalanche of
2505.

00:03:33.469 --> 00:03:38.870
And one day, a massive garbage landslide causes
Joe's hibernation pod to end up in a random

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:39.870
house.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:42.599
Joe gets out of the pod dizzy and confused.

00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:45.590
The person in the house is named Frito Pendejo.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:50.049
Frito completely ignores a pile of garbage
and a stranger in his house and continues

00:03:50.049 --> 00:04:01.249
watching weird shows on TV.

00:04:01.249 --> 00:04:04.209
He only gets up to ask Joe to not make a noise.

00:04:04.209 --> 00:04:08.400
We see that his couch also has a toilet so
he wouldn’t have to get up time and again.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.739
He then kicks Joe out of the window.

00:04:10.739 --> 00:04:15.280
The outside world seems confusing to Joe and
he says to himself so much has changed in

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:16.280
just a year.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.320
But little does he know he has entered the
year 2505.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.790
He sees a group of people by the side of the
road who talk in slang and grunts.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.720
Joe is able to understand them but when he
speaks like his normal self, they call him

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.590
slurs and chase him away.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:35.390
A confused Joe also feels dizzy so he decides
to go to a nearby hospital.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:39.830
There, he goes to the reception and tells
her he is from the army.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:44.170
The woman doesn’t understand anything and
just presses one of many buttons on her desk.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:48.340
A voice asks Joe to proceed to the diagnostic
area on the right.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:52.480
Confused, he goes to drink some water from
a water fountain but it supplies an energy

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.310
drink called the Brawndo instead of water.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:59.490
When Joe asks a bystander where he can drink
water, the man laughs at Joe for wanting to

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:00.642
drink something they use in toilets.

00:05:00.642 --> 00:05:01.642
It is revealed that everyone in the world
uses Brawndo to bathe, drink and for daily

00:05:01.642 --> 00:05:02.642
activities, while water is only used in toilets.

00:05:02.642 --> 00:05:07.170
Then, he goes to the diagnostic area where
he has to put plugs into his mouth, ear, and

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.170
anus.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.930
The health professional mismatches the plugs
that he already put into specific areas.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.090
A disgusted Joe completes the procedure and
is sent to a doctor.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:22.090
While waiting he sees the date 2505 written
on a magazine but dismisses it as a misprint.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:27.980
The doctor arrives and answers all of Joe’s
questions about his health with “kick ass”.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:33.500
He also declares Joe retarded and asks him
to pay a fee of five billion dollars.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.530
Just then, Joe notices 2505 written on the
bill.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:42.610
He finally realises that he has actually been
inside the pod for five hundred years.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:46.550
Joe almost doesn’t believe it and goes to
the window only to be surprised to see the

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.960
current condition of the city.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.960
Buildings are collapsing onto each other and
some are held together by ropes.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:49.960
In addition, the city is filled with garbage.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.390
Meanwhile, the doctor freaks out because Joe
doesn’t have a citizen tattoo on his wrist.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:57.570
Joe panics and runs away from the hospital
while the doctor calls the police on him for

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:58.980
not paying his hospital bills.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:02.820
A voice narrates that Joe has woken up to
a world in crisis.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:07.670
The economy is in deep neglect, a great dust
bowl has ravaged all food supplies and the

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.590
number one movie in the country is called
Ass.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:16.740
He goes to watch the movie that won oscars
only to stare at someone’s behind for ninety

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.760
straight minutes.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:21.800
At night, he is arrested for being “unscannable”
and taken to a court.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:26.241
There, he is given a lawyer who happens to
be Frito Pendejo, the guy that Joe met the

00:06:26.241 --> 00:06:27.241
first in 2505.

00:06:27.241 --> 00:06:30.190
Frito makes fun of him as everyone in the
court laughs.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:34.590
Joe presents his case sensibly and and explains
why he is unscannable but the lawyers and

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.390
judge just laugh at him.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:40.060
At last the Judge declares him guilty and
sentences him to jail.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:45.080
Meanwhile, Rita also comes out of the pod
and is trying to contact her manager and boyfriend

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.160
Upgrayedd.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:50.720
She is unsuccessful as the phone asks her
for two thousand dollars to contact him.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.710
Just then, she is approached by a man who
she tricks and gets his money.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:59.280
At the same time, Joe is taken to an automated
tattoo place where the citizens are given

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:02.390
the identification tattoo that makes them
“scannable”.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:07.000
The machine asks him his name but Joe starts
to explain that he is not sure what is going

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.000
on.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.460
Because of this, the machine reads his name
as “not sure” and tattoos it on his wrist.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.510
The people around him also start calling him
Not Sure.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:17.750
Then, he is taken to an amplitude and IQ test
and asked questions about basic addition.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.560
Joe answers all of them correctly and is surprised
to see people around him not being able to

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.300
identify shapes.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:26.090
After that, he is taken to the prison.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:30.020
He finally begins to realise that everyone
in the current world is stupid.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.120
So, he tells the guard he is supposed to get
out of jail today.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.530
The stupid guard lets him walk away but the
alarms catch that an inmate has ran away and

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.740
the police chase him down the streets.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:43.270
Joe somehow gets away from them and goes to
Frito’s place again.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:47.330
He believes that someone has created a time
machine within the past five hundred years

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.400
and asks Frito’s help in getting one.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:53.270
Frito doesn’t agree on helping Joe but Joe
tricks him by saying that he will give him

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:55.340
eight billion dollars for his help.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:08:00.270
Eventually Frito reveals that he knows where
the time machine is.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:03.350
Just then, the police knock on the door looking
for Joe.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:06.650
The two run away through the window and drive
to the museum.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:10.050
On their way they meet Rita who is still scamming
the same guy.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:14.270
Rita gets in the car and is worried that Upgrayedd
will come looking for the money she owes him,

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:16.860
still oblivious that he is already dead.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:20.950
As they drive, something from outside the
car scans Joe’s wrist and the police are

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.520
notified of his location.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.170
The car’s battery runs out and they get
out of it.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.240
Right after, the police approach the car and
fire at it.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:31.750
Soon, a bunch of people join and start to
fight.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:36.459
Joe, Frito, and Rita run away in hopes of
getting to the time machine.

00:08:36.459 --> 00:08:40.450
Joe then takes the two to Costco which is
now the centre of all trades.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.500
He even claims to have studied law in Costco.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.329
As they wait for the metro, Rita goes to the
bathroom.

00:08:46.329 --> 00:08:50.910
Before she returns, Joe’s wrist is accidentally
scanned and the whole place is alerted of

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.279
a criminal’s presence.

00:08:52.279 --> 00:08:56.990
The metro arrives and Frito gets on it but
Joe waits for Rita only to be caught by the

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:57.990
police.

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:01.529
However, this time, he is taken to the white
house instead of prison.

00:09:01.529 --> 00:09:06.170
There, a confused Joe meets the president
Camacho and his secretaries.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:10.399
Camacho makes fun of him saying that he thought
Joe’s head would be bigger because he is

00:09:10.399 --> 00:09:11.399
smart.

00:09:11.399 --> 00:09:15.110
It turns out that the IQ test Joe took in
the prison surprised everyone because he had

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.480
the highest IQ they had ever seen.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:22.160
Hence, because of his intelligence, the president
makes Joe the new secretary of interior.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:26.370
To Joe’s surprise, they also declare him
the smartest man in the world.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:30.300
Everyone then goes to the house of representin’
where the president announces that the problems

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:35.930
of food scarcity and dust storm will be solved
by their new secretary of interior, Mr. Not

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:36.930
Sure.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.019
He also promises to pardon Joe’s prison
time if he solves the problem.

00:09:41.019 --> 00:09:45.860
After that, a cabinet meeting is held where
the secretaries ask Joe to say something smart.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:51.589
Joe says some random complicated words making
them believe that he is infact smart.

00:09:51.589 --> 00:09:56.600
Then Joe asks Frito to draw a map of the location
of the time machine until he distracts the

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.600
secretaries.

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:01.230
Later, he takes them to a field where crops
are supposed to be grown.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:04.970
He also asks them to get Rita because she
might be able to help them with the crops.

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:07.829
Now, everyone is at the field where Frito
secretly hands Joe the map.

00:10:07.829 --> 00:10:10.149
At the same time, Rita arrives there.

00:10:10.149 --> 00:10:13.410
Joe takes her aside planning to run away using
the map.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:17.490
But his plan fails when he sees that Frito’s
map is just a line.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:23.040
Then, Joe realises that people have been watering
the crops with the energy drink brawndo.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:26.680
He holds a cabinet meeting to start using
water instead of brawndo.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:30.329
The secretaries think his idea is atrocious.

00:10:30.329 --> 00:10:35.240
So, instead of reasoning with them, he simply
tells them that he can talk to the plants

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.649
and they want water.

00:10:36.649 --> 00:10:41.389
Joe is unknown that the energy drink had caused
salt to develop over top soil which killed

00:10:41.389 --> 00:10:43.370
plants and caused the dust storms.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.970
Hence, he is actually solving their problems.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.199
For a few days everything goes as planned.

00:10:48.199 --> 00:10:53.079
But soon, the energy drink brawndo’s stocks
drop to zero because of the decreased production.

00:10:53.079 --> 00:10:55.689
This leaves half the population unemployed.

00:10:55.689 --> 00:11:01.529
They riot outside the white house.

00:11:01.529 --> 00:11:05.970
The news announces that Joe is taken to court
for making people unemployed and is proven

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:06.999
to be guilty.

00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:09.899
He is sentenced to one night in rehabilitation.

00:11:09.899 --> 00:11:14.180
In the new world, rehabilitation is when a
criminal is chased by a large truck in an

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:16.839
arena as a crowd of audience cheers for the
truck.

00:11:16.839 --> 00:11:20.139
The rehabilitation mostly ends with the criminal’s
death.

00:11:20.139 --> 00:11:24.329
Joe is taken to the arena while Rita sadly
returns to the white house, ready to go to

00:11:24.329 --> 00:11:26.089
the time machine with Frito.

00:11:26.089 --> 00:11:29.560
The rehabilitation is broadcasted on national
television.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:35.990
Joe is chased by a massive killing turck as
he drives around in a small car.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:39.269
Just then, Rita notices a rose plant growing
outside.

00:11:39.269 --> 00:11:43.559
She realises that Joe’s idea to water the
plants had worked and asks Frito to take her

00:11:43.559 --> 00:11:44.639
to the arena.

00:11:44.639 --> 00:11:49.660
She plans to broadcast the crops on the television
so Joe’s punishment would be pardoned.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:53.439
Meanwhile, Joe is still trying to save his
life from the death truck.

00:11:53.439 --> 00:11:58.379
Rita reaches there on time and bribes a cameraman
to go with Frito and film the growing crops.

00:11:58.379 --> 00:12:01.779
She then goes to the monitoring room and takes
over the control panel.

00:12:01.779 --> 00:12:04.499
Frido finally gets to the field and films
the crops.

00:12:04.499 --> 00:12:07.180
The clip is broadcasted on the large screen.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:12.149
Seeing this, president Camacho saves Joe from
being killed and pardons his punishment making

00:12:12.149 --> 00:12:14.089
the crowd erupt in cheers.

00:12:14.089 --> 00:12:17.019
Now, everyone is at a frat party in the white
house.

00:12:17.019 --> 00:12:21.160
Rita reveals that she doesn’t want to return
home because she likes the future better.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.740
Joe is surprised but doesn’t force her to
come with him.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:28.020
The two say their last goodbye, but before
Joe leaves, the president calls him on the

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.910
stage and declares him the new vice president.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:35.139
Everyone looks at Joe with hopeful eyes making
him agree to stay in 2505.

00:12:35.139 --> 00:12:39.339
Then, one person calls the “time machine”
a stupid ride.

00:12:39.339 --> 00:12:43.410
Frito takes a confused Joe to the machine
and it is finally revealed that the time machine

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.639
is actually a children’s ride.

00:12:45.639 --> 00:12:49.699
The scene cuts a few months later, when Joe
is elected as the president of the United

00:12:49.699 --> 00:12:53.420
states and Rita becomes his wife and the first
lady.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:57.959
Under his leadership, a new era dawned and
people hoped that humans could once again

00:12:57.959 --> 00:12:59.000
be smart.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:03.649
He even has three kids with Rita who are said
to be the smartest kids in the world.

